        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Francine offers a simple method that's easy to reconcile with what the rest of the family eats. She explains how our system works to understand the impact of our actions on weight loss. And always so friendly, a great meeting!",
        "time": 1554337870,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Valérie Leduc",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108911175552907606552/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWh2l4ojeg5dltV3L24wVx4flHup0PapTdr9Trs7k-REeJWZQ4R=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I've been following a weight loss program with Francine for a year and a half and I'm very happy with the results. Of course, it requires dedication and effort, but I benefit from excellent support and her many years of experience. My first requirement: to be on a \"diet\" and not feel hungry. And, well, that's possible! With Francine, I understand how my body works, and that has allowed me to change my eating habits to realign them with my actual needs. I really appreciated that my plan was realistic and tailored to my situation. It's an investment in my health and that of my family. :)",
        "time": 1560215243,
        "translated": true
      },
